        "Against always guessing the training years' average chance (no skill), the 95% interval of the difference does not lie wholly below zero, so its gain over that simpler guess is not certain.",
        "The model was chosen from three candidates on these same test years, so its scores may be slightly optimistic.",
        "Rain comes from 3 Open-Meteo grid cells (about 9 km across) for 22 barangays, so barangays in one cell share the same rain and small storms can be missed.",
        "The records come from news reports, so an empty barangay-day means nothing was reported, not that nothing happened: the chances describe reported floods and read lower than the true rate."
      ]
